      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/spanish-colonial-coinage/1-escudo-carlos-iv-1802/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/spanish-colonial-coinage/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Spanish colonial coin catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Spanish Colonial Coin &middot; Viceroyalty of New Granada &middot; Reign of Charles IV (1788&ndash;1808)</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">1 Gold Escudo &mdash; 1802</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Official Portrait of Charles IV &middot; Santa Fe de Bogotá Mint (NR)</p>\n      </div>\n<div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n<button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"carlos-iv-1802\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the 1 escudo de 1802\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in; background:#1c1a15; border-radius:4px; padding:24px;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-1-escudo-carlos-iv-1802-bogota.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-1-escudo-carlos-iv-1802-bogota.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Gold 1-escudo of Charles IV, Bogotá 1802 — obverse with the official portrait of the king (left) and reverse with the crowned royal coat of arms (right)\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"310\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (left) and reverse (right) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n</div>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.75; color:#332e22; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">Unlike the transitional 1791 2-escudo piece in the collection, this 1-escudo coin already bears the official, definitive portrait design of<strong>Carlos IV</strong>, with her characteristic aquiline profile and her hair tied up in ribbon. It is a clean and well-centered piece, with clear legends and a uniform roundness &mdash;representative of the gold coin that circulated in the Viceroyalty of New Granada at the dawn of the nineteenth century.</p>\n\n      <section id=\"1-escudo-1802\" style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;\">\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 0 40px;\">\n          \n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country / Viceroyalty</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">New Kingdom of Granada (present-day Colombia)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Mint / Assayer</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Santa Fe de Bogotá (brand &ldquo;NR&rdquo;) &middot; Assayer JJ (Juan de Dios del Real and José Antonio Rodríguez)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reign</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Carlos IV (1788&ndash;1808)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Year of minting</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1802</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1 Gold Escudo</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Composition</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Gold .875 (21 carats)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Gross weight</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">~3.38 g</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fine gold content</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">0.0950 troy oz (~2.96 g pure gold)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Diameter</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">~19 mm</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Manufacturing Method</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Machine minting (flywheel press)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Edge</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Reeded edge (diagonal pattern)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog references</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">KM #64.1 &middot; Restrepo M87 &middot; Friedberg Fr-51 &middot; Numista N# 61388</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged 1 escudo de 1802\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"carlos-iv-1802\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-1-escudo-carlos-iv-1802-bogota.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-1-escudo-carlos-iv-1802-bogota.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"1 escudo de oro de Carlos IV, Bogotá 1802, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Obverse and Reverse</h3>\n          <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse &mdash; The Bust:</strong>portrait of Charles IV in armor, facing right, with his characteristic aquiline profile and ribbon-tied hair. Legend:<em>CAROL. IV. D. G. HISP. ET IND. R.</em>(&ldquo;Carlos IV, by the Grace of God, King of Spain and the Indies&rdquo;). The date &ldquo;1802&rdquo; appears sharp and centered under the bust.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse &mdash; The Crowned Shield:</strong>crowned royal coat of arms of Spain, surrounded by the collar of the Order of the Golden Fleece. Legend:<em>IN. UTROQ. FELIX. A. D.</em>(&ldquo;In both worlds, happy under the guidance of God&rdquo;). Flanked by the split designation &ldquo;1&rdquo; (left) and &ldquo;S&rdquo; (right); in the lower register, the mint mark &ldquo;NR&rdquo; (Nuevo Reino, Bogotá) followed by the assayer's initials &ldquo;JJ&rdquo;.</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n\n      </section>\n\n      <blockquote style=\"max-width:760px; margin:56px auto 0; padding:28px 0 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:20px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4331; margin:0 0 10px;\">Minted in 1802, this piece represents the Santa Fe Mint’s stable gold production near the end of the colonial era. The mint had used screw presses since 1757, after a major expansion adapted the building for mechanized production. The official portrait of Charles IV and the regular planchet demonstrate the system’s full consolidation.</p>\n        <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33;\">&mdash; Historical Context Note</span>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <section style=\"max-width:760px; margin:32px auto 0; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n        <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n          <li>Restrepo Restrepo, José Ignacio.<em>Two Hundred Years of Republican Currency in Colombia (1810–2010)</em>— base reference for the Restrepo number.</li>\n          <li>Krause, Chester L. y Clifford Mishler.<em>Standard Catalog of World Coins.</em></li>\n          <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n          <li>Rodríguez Soage, José David.<a href=\"https://www.enumismatic.com/mints-history/santa-fe/es/la-ceca-de-santa-fe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">&laquo;The Santa Fe Mint&raquo;<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a>, eNumismatic, 2021.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "1 Escudo de Oro — 1802",
      "eyebrow": "Moneda Colonial Española · Virreinato de la Nueva Granada · Reinado de Carlos IV (1788&ndash;1808)"
